      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairmont%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fairmont’s development accelerated with the arrival of the Southern Minnesota Railroad in 1878.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
