      ],
      "source": "https://fairmontchamber.org/history-of-fairmont/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Fairmont sits along a chain of five lakes—Lake George, Sisseton, Budd, Hall, and Amber—connected by channels for boating.",
